,{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/085d97951a8c0dfa299a04c34ef63b2029d2dffc040147b42862a1509e572808.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/1802ecda3101994c8c9e425a9392763bf4dc75b727f1ae7c17b3d3ee1454cbd1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/085d97951a8c0dfa299a04c34ef63b2029d2dffc040147b42862a1509e572808.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"2026年三季度GDP同比增长4.5%，前三季度同比增长4.6%","summary":"国家统计局初步核算，2026年三季度GDP为375367亿元，同比增长4.5%；前三季度GDP为1071071亿元，同比增长4.6%。三季度环比增长1.2%，其中信息传输、软件和信息技术服务业同比增长9.8%。","sourceName":"国家统计局","sourceUrl":"https://www.stats.gov.cn/sj/zxfb/202610/t20261020_1965658.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T01:30:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"fxaebnu8vqh756eyg9s9j1yqw"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"宁德时代发布重卡换电新生态，华为引望计划2027年推出换电车型","summary":"宁德时代发布重卡领域标准化换电块及骐骥换电站3.0，规划2027年建成2000座换电站；华为引望与宁德时代签署战略合作，计划于2027年推出首款合作换电车型。此外，蔚来与吉利达成充换电全面战略合作，多家车企加入蔚来换电联盟。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202610203901431583.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T10:08:20.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"gz4azz4sk9wlb82tww0vl4319"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"突破110美元大关！中东战火点燃油市 布油升至五个月新高","summary":"布伦特原油突破110美元，触及五个月新高，受中东冲突推动地缘风险溢价计入。WTI crude 亦升至9月以来高位104.94美元，显示整体油价上行压力。欧洲天然气期货升至2022年底以来最高88.59欧元/兆瓦时，受地缘风险带动能源成本普遍上扬。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://stock.eastmoney.com/news/1768,202610203901485357.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T11:43:23.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"x5af3kj0j5n5mjea4nlixk7ht"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":"ixm96zhucuoptkskvfrjlofb6","title":"吴清金融街论坛讲话释放多项资本市场政策信号","summary":"证监会主席吴清在2026金融街论坛年会开幕式上表示，资本市场将坚持稳中求进，并推出覆盖产品创新、监管机制、基础制度、多层次市场和高水平开放的12项举措。当天首批18只主动ETF获批注册，策略上均衡9只、价值4只、红利3只、质量1只、大盘成长1只，其中13只采用基本面主动选股、5只采用量化策略；同日北交所落地新股市值配售和创新性评价两项制度。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15211652.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T10:10:20.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"followUp":"2026-10-20"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"哈萨克斯坦法院对 Coinbase、BingX 等六家未持牌平台发布禁令","summary":"哈萨克斯坦阿斯塔纳国际金融中心法院（AIFC）禁止 Coinbase、BingX、Bitcoin.com、Huobi Global（HTX）、BitMart 和 WEEX 六家未获牌照的平台在当地提供数字资产服务。禁令范围扩大至应用商店，要求谷歌和苹果采取限制措施。LBank 此前因屏蔽哈萨克斯坦用户访问而被移出名单。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2297593","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T11:26:36.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"qjo2gt94sjelgcnb8ukimia3x"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp",